        {
          "id": 3601047165,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> I do agree with renaming that entry.\n\n!25914 submitted to do that. I referred to it as \"Vector Informatik\" rather than just \"Vector\", to make it easier to look the company up. That might be a good idea for ASC as well.\n\nShould we speak of \"logfile(s)\" or, as you did, \"log file(s)\"? Unless the vendor uses \"logfile\", my inclination would be to use \"log file\".",
