        {
          "id": 3603126378,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Should we speak of \"logfile(s)\" or, as you did, \"log file(s)\"? \n\nMy bet is on log file(s), but I am not a native English speaker.\n\n> Unless the vendor uses \"logfile\", my inclination would be to use \"log file\".\n\nVector uses log file in the manual:\n\n![kép.png](/uploads/f8a41b9e5a8d4342c5aae50cbc2bc98f/k%C3%A9p.png){width=793 height=156}",
